#: ../../districts.rst:1
msgid "Sixteen districts, sixteen entry routes"
msgstr "十六区，十六条对接路径"

#: ../../districts.rst:4
msgid ""
"Every district has a chapter. We begin with its documented specialization "
"and receiving authority, then follow the local organizations. An official "
"portal remains the contact route when no current named officer or direct "
"intake form is established."
msgstr "每个区均设章节，从有来源的产业方向和主管部门出发，再了解本地机构。尚无经核实现任联系人或直接表格时，以官方门户作为联系入口。"

